  "place": "dungeon sulphur_mine (The Yellow Pits, Sulphur Bight, level 13-16): the end boss in the Firecaller's Pit",
  "_doc": "The Slagborn firecaller who lights the sulphur seams to drive the diggers deeper. P1 \"Lighting the Seams\": firebolts at the tank, a fire cone, and SEAM FIRE — the four yellow seams in the walls flare all at once (stay away from them); two water barrels (levers, repeatable) put out the burning ground she leaves. P2 at 60% \"Choking Pit\": the pit fills with yellow smoke; she drops soaks of burning sulphur that need two players each, and a long cast you must interrupt (Call the Diggers) or she gets two raiders. P3 new bar \"The Pit Burns\": the floor is alight except a few safe circles, she chains fire between players (spread) and her seams burn on a short timer. OWNER #51 (2026-10-15): the phase that refilled the health bar is removed; the health bar is the whole fight.",
  "party": "Solo: hard — interrupt the call, skip the soaks only if you must. 2-3: one on the barrels. 5: as designed.",
